{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43511","headline":"骊龙 · 无名氏","name":"骊龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有美爲鳞族，潜蟠得所从。\n标奇初韫宝，表智即称龙。\n大壑长千里，深泉固九重。\n奋髯云乍起，矫首浪还冲。\n荀氏传高誉，庄生冀绝踪。\n仍知流泪在，何幸此相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}